Enchantment Descriptions for Sunrise 26.3 (version 0.5.0)

A port of Enchantment Descriptions (26.3.0) by Darkhax.
Original source: https://github.com/Darkhax-Minecraft/Enchantment-Descriptions
Original licence: LGPL-2.1 (GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1, in LICENSE)

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko: the tooltip rules are written in Rust on Sunrise's typed mod
API; no Java code is included. This port is distributed under the same licence as the
original (LGPL-2.1-only).

Carried from the original under the same licence:
- assets/enchantmentdescriptions/lang/*.json: the description strings in the original's 25
  language files (English, German, Spanish, French, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Dutch, Polish,
  Portuguese, Russian, Swedish, Tamil, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Chinese and others),
  written by Darkhax and the translators credited in the original's history. The only change
  is the settings screen's strings, added to the end of en_us.json.
- icon.png: the original's logo (logo_enchdesc.png).
